        "Large end head / grip mass",
        "External corner rounding (R30-class) via cylinders and spherical corner blend",
        "Local small edge rounds (R5-class) near head-arm transition corner"
      ],
      "function intent": "Provide a robust grasp/impact-resistant mass and a load introduction region for the lever arm, reducing stress concentration via large radii.",
      "physical behavior": "Acts as a stiffened mass at the end of the arm; large fillets and smooth blends reduce peak stresses under bending/handling loads and improve durability against knocks.",
      "geometry": "Bulky end block with rounded external corners: multiple quarter-cylindrical rounds (radius ~30) and a spherical corner blend (radius ~30), with planar end/front/back/bottom boundary faces. Includes the shoulder plane at the head-to-arm transition (x≈100).",
